Import "../Engineering.lingua"

Include people and operating conditions in the engineering function (@engineering-operation-task: 0, is #chapter, #hephaestus-core "Separate-commands-operating-modes-and-physical-transitions.lingua#r_008C1B131F96EEDA40AFFB9727") { r_00251664228CAF775198D8DB57
A realized system delivers its function through people, equipment, information, materials and a setting. Reuse [Turn an intended use into requirements and observable evidence](Turn-an-intended-use-into-requirements-and-observable-evidence.lingua#r_0C3988C75ECA342B8BFC943458), [Trace material energy and information across interfaces](Trace-material-energy-and-information-across-interfaces.lingua#r_0247145FE15239D16A42C0B328) and [Begin an interaction with the person and the task being attempted](../../computer-science/core/Begin-an-interaction-with-the-person-and-the-task-being-attempted.lingua#r_00DB108C84234052A2E708BF49). Specify who prepares the work, who operates, who maintains, who receives the output and who is affected by interruption. Their tasks can require different information and different authority. An operating instruction is one component of this arrangement, not the complete service.

Consider an original paper exercise with two cards, an incoming space, a one-card buffer and a finished space. A person requests transfer; a demonstrator later moves cards according to explicit rules. The goal is to finish both cards without losing their account or misinterpreting outstanding work. No equipment is powered, and the code simulates only counts and messages. This narrow model makes command, physical movement and evidence separable without pretending to reproduce a workshop.

List the resources even here: the two distinguishable spaces plus output, legible labels, cards, a request marker, a visible operating-mode marker, time to inspect and a person responsible for the next action. The counts conserve two cards; the buffer has capacity one. The marker records an outstanding requested transfer, not a third card. An empty buffer does not prove that no transfer remains requested. Likewise, a request marker is not proof that a card moved.

For actual engineering, add the relevant material and energy paths, access, environmental conditions, measurement limitations and support. Human reach, perception, attention, strength, knowledge and cooperation are design considerations to investigate in the intended context. Do not infer that every operator shares the designer's capabilities or that more training repairs an ambiguous display. [HSE human failure procedures and shift handover](../sources/HSE-human-failure-procedures-and-shift-handover.lingua#r_005E57B92B1E14D9A4710D1943) supplies selected human-failure and procedure guidance; its institutional context does not make this exercise a compliance assessment.

**Work:** write the operating task separately from its proposed controls. Identify the information needed before requesting, after requesting, after an interruption and during handover. Name one requirement that a correct count alone would miss. Reuse [Specify accessible actions feedback and recoverable input errors](../../computer-science/core/Specify-accessible-actions-feedback-and-recoverable-input-errors.lingua#r_007E1E3B2807ADC4AA74817156) to express action and state without relying on color, position or one input method. Distinguish an authored task model from observations of real people doing work.

**Continue:** [Separate commands operating modes and physical transitions](Separate-commands-operating-modes-and-physical-transitions.lingua#r_008C1B131F96EEDA40AFFB9727).

**Return:** [Engineering](../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68).
